==German==

===Etymology===
Perhaps from {{compound|de|Amt|Simile}} (from {{etyl|la|de}} {{m|la|simile||similar}}), the name of a standardized form used by the bureaucracy of the Austrian Empire. Alternatively, perhaps a reference to the service horses ({{compound|de|Amt|Schimmel|t1=official|t2=white horse}}) which were provided in Switzerland and elsewhere to government officials.

